<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_4">Why is the 2026 Annual Meeting being held via live audio webcast?</a></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">2</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_5">How do I participate in the virtual meeting?</a></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">2</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_6">What if I need technical support prior to or during the 2026 Annual Meeting?</a></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">3</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_7">Will I be able to participate in the virtual meeting on the same basis I would be able to participate in a live annual meeting?</a></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">3</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_8">If I am a shareholder of record, how do I access my <span style="white-space:nowrap">15-Digit</span> Control Number assigned by Computershare and how do I vote?</a></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">3</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_9">If I am a beneficial owner of shares held in street name, how do I access my <span style="white-space:nowrap">15-Digit</span> Control Number assigned by Computershare and how do I vote?</a></p></td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right">4</td>
<td style="white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:bottom">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:3.00em; text-indent:-1.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><a href="#txa23154_10">Why is there information regarding the Internet availability of proxy materials?</a></p></td>
